@page "/Privacy"


<div class="flex-col-container main-container">

    <h2>Privacy Policy for forbidden-knowledge.com</h2>


    <div>

        <p>
            Effective Date: 10/23/2024
        </p>

        <p>
            Welcome to forbidden-knowledge.com (the "Site").
            This privacy policy aims to inform you about the type of information that is collected by the Site and how it is used and protected.
        </p>


        <p class="privacy-policy-subheader">
            1. Personal Information Collected
        </p>


        <p>
            forbidden-knowledge.com is committed to the privacy of our visitors.
            At this time, time the Site collects only very limited personal information from users.
            All personal information is voluntarily submitted by users themselves.
            For security purposes, our servers automatically log all HTTP/HTTPS requests made against the Site.
            These logs include IP addresses and browser details but are solely used to monitor for potential security breaches and ensure the integrity of the Site.
            Features that collect email addresses and names may be implemented in the future in order to add functionality to the Site.
            Providing information such as name, email address, and phone number is voluntary and will never be given or sold to third parties. 

        </p>


        <p class="privacy-policy-subheader">
            2. Use of Information
        </p>

        <p>
            Any information collected by forbidden-knowledge.com, is used only for authenticating user accounts, and for security monitoring purposes.
            Logs help us detect and respond to potential security threats by analyzing traffic patterns and identifying malicious activities.
            Logs are kept securely and are accessed only when necessary to investigate security incidents.
            forbidden-knowledge will never sell or give user information to a third party.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy-policy-subheader">
            3. Third-party Links
        </p>

        <p>
            Our Site contains links to other websites operated by third parties.
            These links are provided for your convenience and do not signify our endorsement of such other websites or their content.
            forbidden-knowledge.com is not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites.
            We encourage users to be aware when they leave our Site and to read the privacy statements of other websites that collect personally identifiable information.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy-policy-subheader">
            4. Cloudflare as Our DNS Provider
        </p>

        <p>
            We use Cloudflare as our DNS provider.
            Cloudflare may collect certain information about DNS requests made to our domain, such as geographic location, in order to provide their services. 
            This collection is managed under Cloudflare’s own privacy policy, which can be accessed on their website.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy-policy-subheader">
            5. Consent
        </p>

        <p>
            By using our Site, you hereby consent to our privacy policy and agree to its terms.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy-policy-subheader">
            6. Changes to Our Privacy Policy
        </p>

        <p>
            forbidden-knowledge.com reserves the right to make changes to this privacy policy at any time. 
            When we do, we will revise the updated date at the top of this page.
            We encourage users to frequently check this page for any changes to stay informed about how we are helping to protect the personal information we collect.
            Your continued use of the Site following the posting of changes to this policy will be deemed your acceptance of those changes.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy-policy-subheader">
            Contacting Us
        </p>

        <p>
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, the practices of this site, or your dealings with this site, please contact us at:
        </p>

        <p>
            admin@forbidden-knowledge.com
        </p>

        <p>
            This document was last updated on 10/23/2024.
        </p>


    </div>

</div>


